      "canonical_latex": "E_a = \\Delta^\\ddagger H^\\circ + RT \\quad (\\text{unimolecular / solution}),\\qquad E_a = \\Delta^\\ddagger H^\\circ + (1 - \\Delta^\\ddagger n_{\\mathrm{gas}})RT \\quad (\\text{ideal gas})",
